{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24143","headline":"赠皇甫六张十五李二十三宾客 · 白居易","name":"赠皇甫六张十五李二十三宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日三川新罢守，今年四皓尽分司。\n幸陪散秩闲居日，好是登山临水时。\n家未苦贫常酝酒，身虽衰病尚吟诗。\n龙门泉石香山月，早晚同游报一期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}